|content3=
* June 9th - '''ARCRED''' part ways with [[SoLb]]. <ref name="-SoLb">{{cite web|url=https://www.instagram.com/p/Cej4uYeNZSG/|title=Пришло время для изменений в текущем ростере ARCRED|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=It's time for a change to the current ARCRED roster|date=2022-06-09|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref>
* June 20th - '''ARCRED''' sign [[hurtslxrd]]. <ref name="+hurtslxrd">{{cite web|url=https://www.instagram.com/p/CfBpf79Nu4B/|title=Hurtslxrd в стае ARCRED!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Hurtslxrd in the ARCRED pack!|date=2022-06-20|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref>
* December 13th - '''ARCRED''' part ways with [[eN0o]]. <ref name="-eN0o">{{cite web|url=https://www.instagram.com/p/CmHIywtNKKp/|title=После долгих размышлений о итогах выступлений ARCRED в 2022 году, организация приняла решение о замене в CS:GO составе|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=After much thought about the results of ARCRED performances in 2022, the organization has decided to replace the CS:GO roster|date=2022-12-13|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref>
* December 28th - '''ARCRED''' sign [[sm3t]]. <ref name="+sm3t">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-188994701_6050|title=После многочисленных тестов мы готовы объявить о том что, Матвей "sm3t" Гогин становится новым игроком CS:GO состава ARCRED!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=After numerous tests, we are ready to announce that Matvey "sm3t" Gogin becomes a new CS:GO player of the ARCRED roster!|date=2022-12-28|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref>

|content4=
* January 12th - [[sm3t]] leaves '''ARCRED''' to join [[flowstate]]. <ref name="-sm3t">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-213780846_227|title=FLOWSTATE с радостью готовы представить вам 5-ого игрока нашего ростера по CS:GO Матвея "sm3t" Гогина|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=FLOWSTATE is pleased to present you the 5th player of our CS:GO roster Matvey "sm3t" Gogin|date=2023-01-12|author=[[flowstate]]}}</ref>
* January 19th - '''ARCRED''' sign [[t4RG3T]]. <ref name="+t4RG3T">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-188994701_6058|title=ROSTER UPDATE!|date=2023-01-19|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref>
* May 5th - '''ARCRED''' part ways with [[t4RG3T]]. <ref name="-t4RG3T">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-152085079_681|title=FFT открыт к предложениям, опорник всех плентов|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=FFT is open to offers, the defender of all bombsites|date=2023-05-05|author=[[t4RG3T]]}}</ref>
* June 3rd - '''ARCRED''' sign [[shg]]. <ref name="+shg">{{cite web|url=https://www.instagram.com/p/CtBoBkeN4yd/|title=ROSTER UPDATE!|date=2023-06-03|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref>

|content5=
* January 20th - '''ARCRED''' replace [[hurtslxrd]] with [[synyx]]. <ref name="-hurtslxrd">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-188994701_6615|title=Сегодня мы прощаемся с Ренатом @hurtslxrd Cапаровым|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Today we say goodbye to Renat @hurtslxrd Saparov|date=2024-01-20|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref><ref name="+synyx">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-188994701_6616|title=Пополнение в составе ARCRED|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=New members of ARCRED|date=2024-01-20|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref>
* January 25th - '''ARCRED''' replace [[Ryujin]] with [[Get_Jeka]]. <ref name="-Ryujin">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/ARCREDesports/status/1750451064044961969|title=See you again Ryujin|date=2024-01-25|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref><ref name="+Get_Jeka">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/ARCREDesports/status/1750523194627457233|title=Introducing the latest player - Get_Jeka|date=2024-01-25|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref>
* September 8th - [[shg]] steps down from the active lineup due to health reasons. <ref name="shg inactive">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/arcredofficial/2442|title=Произошли временные изменения в нашей команде по CS2!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=There have been some temporary changes to our CS2 team!|date=2024-09-08|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref>
* November 11th - '''ARCRED''' part ways with [[synyx]]. <ref name="-synyx">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/ARCREDesports/status/1855941321128820881|title=It's time to say goodbye!|date=2024-11-11|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref>

|content6=
* January 17th - '''ARCRED''' re-sign [[Ryujin]] and reinstate [[shg]] to the active roster. <ref name="+ryujin">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/ARCREDesports/status/1880287993841471504|title=Let's continue with the announcements! Next up, our updated Counter-Strike 2 roster|date=2025-01-17|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref>
* April 16th - '''ARCRED''' part ways with [[1NVISIBLEE]]. <ref name="-1NVISIBLEE">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/ARCREDesports/status/1912513448723751095|title=Every fairytale has an end, and so does our journey with Danila "1NVISIBLEE"...|date=2025-04-16|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref>
* April 24th - '''ARCRED''' sign [[Raijin]]. <ref name="+raijin">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/ARCREDesports/status/1915447570752573668|title=He is here|date=2025-04-24|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref>
* May 20th - [[shg]] steps down from '''ARCRED'''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s active roster due to his military service. <ref name="shg military">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/arcredofficial/3017|date=2025-05-20|title=К сожалению, наш игрок Артём "shg" Шагинян вынужден приостановить участие в соревновательной сцене на неопределённый срок в связи с прохождением военной службы|language={{flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Unfortunately, our player Artem "shg" Shaginyan is forced to suspend participation in the competitive scene for an indefinite period due to military service|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref>
*July 20th - '''ARCRED''' acquire [[redzed]] on loan from [[RUSTEC]]. <ref name="+redzed Loan">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/rustec_gaming/635|title=Георгий «redzed» Заверткин присоединяется к коллективу ARCRED на правах аренды!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Georgiy "redzed" Zavertkin joins the ARCRED team on loan!|date=2025-07-20|author=[[RUSTEC]]}}</ref>
* October 9th - [[redzed]] is acquired by [[Aurora Young Blud]]. <ref name="-redzed">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/AuroraTeam/6012|title=Aurora YB: +redzed|date=2025-10-09|author=[[Aurora Gaming]]}}</ref>
* December 19th - '''ARCRED''' part ways with [[Chill]]. <ref name="-Chill">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/chill_esport/status/2002025985147887671|title=Leaving a team Arcred after 3 month together|date=2025-12-19|author=[[Chill]]}}</ref>

|content7=
* January 9th - '''ARCRED''' sign [[synyx]]. <ref name="+synyx 2026">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/arcredesports/status/2009594056410906786|title=WELCOME BACK @SYNYXCS|date=2026-01-09|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref>
* July 10th - '''ARCRED''' move [[Get_Jeka]] to a content creator role within the organization and reinstate [[shg]] to the active roster. <ref name="Get_Jeka cc">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/ARCREDesports/status/2075550799158002003|title=Get_Jeka is temporarily stepping away from competitive play to focus on content creation|date=2026-07-10|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref><ref name="shg back 2026">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/ARCREDesports/status/2075567643898044509|title=After completing a year of military service, Artem "shg-" Shaginyan returns to ARCRED's main roster|date=2026-07-10|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref>
* August 17th - '''ARCRED''' part ways with [[shg]]. <ref name="-shg">{{cite web|url=https://vk.ru/wall-112533746_725|title=fft|date=2026-08-17|author=[[shg]]}}</ref>
* August 18th - [[Raijin]] and [[synyx]] are acquired by [[33]]. <ref name="-2 to 33">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/team33_official/307|title=Новая веха в истории BET-M 33|trans_title=A new milestone in the history of BET-M 33|language={{flag|ru}} Russian|date=2026-08-18|author=[[33]]}}</ref>
* September 18th - '''ARCRED''' acquire [[kumao]] on loan from [[Rune Eaters Esports]]. <ref name="+kumao">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/runeeaters/188|title=Kumao переходит в Arcred на правах аренды|language={{flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Kumao joins Arcred on loan|date=2026-09-18|author=[[Rune Eaters Esports]]}}</ref>
* September 29th - '''ARCRED''' acquire [[icyvlone]], [[ManticorE]] and [[ARSPOWER]]. <ref name="+icyvlone,manticore,arspower">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/arcredofficial/4345|title=Новый этап для ARCRED|language={{flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=New stage for ARCRED|date=2026-09-29|author=[[ARCRED]]}}</ref>
}}

